  counting controls: all as expected

## the names, links, properties and protection families through the gate's binary, copied into a worktree
command: git worktree add --detach <tree> <phase commit>
  the worktree is at the phase commit: yes
command: count_matches -E and sed for the host emend-copy hash line in records/logs/m2p4a-p4/gate.log (sha256 2ca7d8201d5cfe51e95f17c6182d67c680f78c3ae70836b099ea777cc19b9074): lines 1; hash 41aae565fe466d8311e4fa0dd4cd3446b51e7a55fcbe4117d79a9fa63cdc95d0
